   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Rutinas y movimiento",
    "@en": "Routines and movement"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Wake up** = despertarse; **go out** = salir; **get back** = volver. **I wake up at seven and go to work at half past seven** (me despierto a las siete y voy al trabajo a las siete y media).",
     "@en": "**Wake up** = wake up; **go out** = exit; **get back** = return. **I wake up at seven and go to work at half past seven** (I wake up at seven and go to work at seven and a half)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Recoger, guardar y sacar",
    "@en": "Collect, save and remove"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Pick up** = recoger; **put away** = guardar; **take out** = sacar. Con un pronombre como **it** o **them**, va en medio: **Pick it up**, **put them away**, **take it out**.",
     "@en": "**Pick up** = collect; **put away** = save; **take out** = remove. With a pronoun like **it** or **them**, it goes in between: **Pick it up**, **put them away**, **take it out**."
    }
   ]
  },
